WEBVTT

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:19.060
The first need is my Stand.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.470
My Stand, The World,

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:28.360
and what lies beyond it are
the path for men to advance further.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.320
My second need is a trustworthy friend.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.660
He must be someone
who can control his desires.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.620
The desire for power, fame, money, sex…

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.410
He must be free of those things.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:48.920
It must be someone who chooses
God's laws over the laws of men.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:54.760
Will I, Dio, ever meet
someone with this character trait?

00:00:55.880 --> 00:01:01.890
I also need
at least 36 souls of the worst convicts.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:06.480
Souls of sinners have tremendous energy.

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:11.650
I need 14 words.

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:14.070
To prevent ever forgetting these words,

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:19.450
I will etch them onto my Stand itself.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.620
I also need courage.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:28.330
I must have the courage to
let go of my Stand just once.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.540
My decaying Stand

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:35.170
will gather and absorb
the souls of 36 convicts.

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:38.300
It will then give birth to something new.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.010
The spawned creature will awaken.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:49.900
It will be curious about the 14 words
spoken by the trusted friend.

00:01:55.610 --> 00:02:00.450
My friend will find me trustworthy
and he will consider me his friend.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.240
Finally, I need the location.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:08.250
It will be north latitude,
28 degrees 24 minutes,

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:11.630
west longitude, 80 degrees 36 minutes.

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:20.090
Wait for the next new moon.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:25.100
Heaven will appear then.

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:30.270
Good morning, Father.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.900
You've grown your hair out.

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:35.070
When was the last time
you returned home to the mainland?

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:38.990
I have no use for this place now.

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:46.330
The birthed creature now belongs to me.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:56.170
The only thing left to do is
to wait for the time of heaven.

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:33.230
EPISODE 23: LOCK OF THE JAIL!

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:36.940
DISCIPLINARY WING

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:48.740
This is the worst!

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.330
How do I get out of this one?

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:53.330
This is the highest
maximum security measure ever.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.420
All the guards have guns too.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.830
It's too dangerous to be here
with all the guards,

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.420
even for just another minute.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:03.050
Hey, Jolyne, can you hear me?

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.050
Are you listening?

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.680
The priest isn't on this island anymore.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:09.600
He already left Green Dolphin Street.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.270
He didn't take anything, though.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:15.390
He wasn't carrying a baby with him!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:19.690
It's too boring in here.
I even pierced my own belly button.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:26.030
Do you have my father's disc, Emporio?
You got it now?

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:29.030
Did you get in contact
with the Speedwagon Foundation?

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.830
I can't. The security is too tight
right now.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.040
I have the disc though, Jolyne.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:36.620
I wouldn't put it down. Never.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.460
Good. Well, I'm getting out of here.

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:41.540
-Lead the way.
-Jolyne.

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:43.170
The prison workers think

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.760
that you are the sole survivor from
the Disciplinary Wing.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.760
Though they can't pin it on you,

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.800
you are the only person
they can question right now.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.640
That's why this cell is
under strict observation.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.810
Do you want to leave the cell
and come to my room?

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.730
No, Emporio.

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:02.230
By leave, I mean
getting out of this shitty prison.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.570
I don't have any more time to waste.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.450
I'm breaking out
of the Green Dolphin Island.

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.360
Show me the fastest way out of here.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:14.490
I promise I'll contact
the Speedwagon Foundation.

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.000
I'll even do that today.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.120
Wrong again, Emporio.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:24.130
This problem is much bigger than
retrieving my father's disc now.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:28.880
If F.F. were alive, they would be
going after that priest as we speak.

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:31.930
And now that I read my father's memory,

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:34.470
I understand what Pucchi meant
by 20 years.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:39.060
I now understand why my father
had to seal Dio's ability.

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:42.730
My father would never let
the priest get away.

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:44.980
And I am Jolyne Cujoh!

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:48.190
I have to seal what he has obtained again!

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:53.570
Emporio.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.580
Do you plan to stay here
for the rest of your life?

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.660
It's up to you,
but I want you to come with me.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:02.000
You don't understand, Jolyne.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.500
You don't get it at all.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.340
But I do.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:08.880
I can break out of these bars
in three minutes.

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:10.170
But what about after that?

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:14.300
No one is left to help you.

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:16.220
Ermes, Anastasia…

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:18.770
They are still under treatment
at the medical wing.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:22.060
For some reason, Weather Forecast
has been holed up in his own room.

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.110
He won't even come visit my room.

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:27.440
I can leave through
the Ultra Security House Unit.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:28.690
We got to the wetlands.

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:29.740
We can't.

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:32.950
No jailbreak attempt has ever succeeded.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:36.330
Some prisoners were detained
for even contemplating a breakout.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.830
Anyway, unless you can stop time
like your father,

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:42.670
no one can ever leave this prison.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:46.710
I don't know what,
but there's something about this place.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.010
Something more than surveillance cameras,

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:52.300
as if the prison itself was
a guard with a mind of its own.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:55.890
Emporio, when is the next new moon?

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:57.140
Jolyne,

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:59.640
please, just wait for
the Speedwagon Foundation.

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:03.100
If we risk it, we might even
lose this disc we finally retrieved!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.650
North latitude, 28 degrees 24 minutes.

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.730
West longitude, 80 degrees 36 minutes.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:08.820
Where is that?

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:12.200
J-Jolyne…

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.160
I can't help you with this.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:35.930
I have a message from Pale Snake.

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.260
Everything is over.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.600
Don't try to leave this prison.

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:45.480
If you stay here, we won't get in the way
of you delivering the disc to Jotaro.

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:57.030
You've got guts, I'll give you that.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:59.660
You showed me your face and your Stand.

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:01.040
And what's your name?

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.040
I am Mew Mew.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.790
My Stand is called Jailhouse Lock.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.750
I'm showing it to you as a warning.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:12.590
Did he order you to finish me off?

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:15.470
If your plans are to break out
of this jail, then yes.

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:17.800
My plans?

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.390
No, I don't have any plans.

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:21.180
I'm leaving now!

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.230
Her Stand is in the bars!

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:32.690
I'll say it one more time, Jolyne Cujoh.

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.650
Don't touch the bars.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:38.200
The more you think about escaping,
the closer you'll be to your death.

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:40.370
So this is what your ability does.

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:41.490
Take this!

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:44.500
What?

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.500
Do you need me to get someone?

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.090
Are you okay, Jolyne?

00:09:57.170 --> 00:10:00.300
Where am I? Why am I here?

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:01.800
It's you, Gwess.

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:03.390
Am I in the female wing?

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:05.810
It hurts!

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:10.770
"One, grab a pen as soon as you can."

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:20.030
"Two, you can only retain up to
three new pieces of information."

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:22.990
"Three, defeat the User."

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.870
"Her name is Mew Mew."

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.210
What are these writings
and who wrote them?

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:34.090
Did someone write these
while I was asleep?

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:35.710
4. GO SEE EMPORIO

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.800
Oh, that's right.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.800
I was locked up because of what happened
at the Ultra Security House Unit.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.600
I gave myself a belly piercing.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:44.890
Then, I ran into Emporio.

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:49.310
I told him I'm getting out of here
to go after the priest.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:50.770
And then, after that…

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.770
After that…

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:54.400
I…

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:55.900
What?

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.490
After I said I was leaving,
I remember someone coming.

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:01.610
But who was it?

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:07.540
This is my handwriting. Did I write these?

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:11.420
No way. When did I write them, though?
I don't even remember writing them.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:14.750
Tell me, why am I back here
in the female wing?

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:19.760
Hey! Answer me!

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:21.800
Why are you ignoring me?

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:24.140
I must've been sleeping
since I don't remember.

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.180
I'm serious!

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:29.930
Oh, also, do you have a pen?

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:31.730
I need a pen. Give me one.

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:41.490
Hey, you…

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:43.700
I'm really serious.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:46.620
Do you think I wrote these on myself?

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.740
That I wrote on my own body?

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:54.170
2. YOU CAN ONLY RETAIN UP TO
THREE NEW PIECES OF INFORMATION

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:58.500
Hey, Gwess… be honest.

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:02.760
Have I been asking you the same question
over and over again?

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:06.550
Can you do me a favor?

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:11.810
Can you tell me
all the things I've asked you already?

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:21.240
"Jolyne, the prison doctor
has diagnosed you

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:23.990
with temporary amnesia brought on

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:26.820
by a great shock you received
while in the Hole."

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:31.290
"You can only memorize
up to three things at a time."

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:34.080
"You can still remember the past,

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:37.540
but if you memorize a fourth new thing,
you will forget one."

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:40.840
"However, since this will not affect
your life as a prisoner,

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:44.300
you were sent back
to the female wing two days ago."

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:45.930
Two days?

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.970
I've been here that long?

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:50.640
Get better soon, Jolyne.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:52.140
For two days…

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:55.810
Have I been repeating the same questions
for two whole days?

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:57.650
But why?

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.480
"Defeat the User."

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:02.110
"Her name is Mew Mew."

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.530
This is…

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:07.280
Could this be… No, it can't be…

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:09.120
It's a Stand ability!

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.370
They're trying to keep me
locked up in here!

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:13.700
I'm under attack!

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:15.870
I remember seeing Emporio.

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:17.830
And then…

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:20.670
After that…

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:21.840
After that…

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.800
Let's see… I remember something happening.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.060
WASH YOUR HANDS
DON'T FORGET TO WEAR YOUR PANTIES

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:38.310
Shit!

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.650
What the hell?

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.240
By the way, Gwess,

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:46.860
do you know anyone named Mew Mew?

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:49.530
You haven't asked that yet, Jolyne.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:51.240
Her prisoner cell is upstairs.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.990
I think she has ratty, blond hair.

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:55.370
She's about your height.

00:13:55.450 --> 00:14:00.750
I don't know why she's here,
but I bet she was whoring around.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.590
Where do I go to see her?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:06.090
She was here until a moment ago, Jolyne.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.300
She just walked by.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:18.730
Can you tell me how she looks like again?

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.440
She's about 175cm.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:24.570
Her hair is platinum blonde
and it's ratty.

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.280
She wears fishnets.

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:29.280
This is the female wing.

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:31.530
How did I get back here?

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:37.250
Who's Mew Mew?

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.330
What's the matter?

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.170
No…

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.380
You just said you wanted lunch.

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:44.460
It's almost lunchtime.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:45.920
Is that right?

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:51.720
Don't think about getting out of here,
Jolyne Cujoh.

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:58.560
You can't attack me
and my Jailhouse Lock, ever.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:04.900
STAND NAME: STONE OCEAN
STAND MASTER: JOLYNE CUJOH

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:13.530
Pale Snake was the priest.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:16.660
F.F. figured it out for us.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:20.660
And then….

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:24.540
They died, didn't they?

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:42.560
Bottoms up.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:50.150
I'll avenge you.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:54.110
Hey! Why are you grabbing food?

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:55.660
Give me your ticket first.

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:57.870
I'm here to grab the packed lunch.

00:15:57.950 --> 00:15:59.950
Like I said, ticket first.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:02.790
You won't be sneaking one away.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:05.380
Now show it to me. Stop taking forever.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.960
If you don't have it, then leave.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:09.130
Now scram.

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.170
Next.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:14.300
Did I leave it next to my bed?

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:17.260
I've got to write it somewhere
so I don't forget it.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.470
LEAVE FOOD TICKET IN HERE

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:22.430
What?

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.730
Why am I here again?

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:31.690
Oh, why did I come back up here?

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:36.120
I can't remember a thing.

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:40.490
Why did I come back up here?

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:44.120
Hey Jolyne, that's my lunch!

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:46.250
You ate a good bit of it!

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.750
You ate my favorite cheese penne!

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:52.380
You left your ticket
in your pocket, remember?

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:57.930
Sorry.

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:00.810
I'll get you another one with my ticket.

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:03.060
No, it's fine. Just stop.

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:05.850
I can get it, just give me your ticket.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:12.400
Can you write it down somewhere
that I have your ticket?

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.780
Oh, sorry.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:19.490
I GAVE MY FOOD TICKET TO GWESS

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:23.290
What's this, a User?
Is it referring to a Stand?

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:27.120
Oh, that's right.
I have to go see Emporio.

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:30.210
I tried to break out
of the confinement cell.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:34.840
Emporio must have been with me then.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:38.090
Emporio might know something.

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.720
And I need to get out of here.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:41.600
I GAVE MY FOOD TICKET TO GWESS

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:44.730
Hey, I said the mustard's out!

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:47.690
There's not a squeeze left in here.
Do you have another bottle?

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:53.940
Why does it feel like
I'm always eating the same food?

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:58.530
I don't have an appetite.
I'll just eat the cheese penne.

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:01.080
Can I sit with you, Jolyne?

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:10.210
I'm sitting down here.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.840
I stepped on a cockroach earlier.

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:15.670
It was so gross.

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:20.430
Who is she? She seems to know me.

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.260
Blonde…

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:23.680
Ratty hair…

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:25.060
Fishnet tights.

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:29.350
What the hell did you do that for?

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.060
Do you want mustard?

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:35.280
What about ketchup?

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.700
You aren't fond of dressing, are you?

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:50.170
It's pretty good.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:52.330
Thanks.

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:55.170
By the way, what's your name?

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.210
Oh, no.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:57.800
I'm so sorry,

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:00.180
I spilled it on you! Let's get you clean.

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:04.560
Your arm got drenched.
We need to go clean it off.

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:05.640
Take that jacket off.

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:07.600
2. YOU CAN ONLY RETAIN UP TO
THREE NEW PIECES OF INFORMATION

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:10.480
Oh, that's so much better.
There, all squeaky clean!

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.900
Let's check your pocket too.

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:19.820
That's a gift from me.

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.200
Jailhouse Lock.

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:26.030
Anyone who touches the cell bars
with my Stand in it to try and escape

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:29.200
can then only remember
three pieces of information.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:32.540
Their life is then restricted
by the three memories.

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:35.670
It's worse than not having
any memories at all.

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:39.550
They experience over and over again

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:42.470
that everything they do is meaningless.

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:45.930
Eventually, this cycle of failure
becomes etched in their bodies.

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:50.020
They then lose all drive to escape.

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:52.350
You can even say that they are crippled.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:56.820
This is what you get
for trying to break out.

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:03.030
What do I need to do?

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:04.530
What's important to me?

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:06.620
What shouldn't I forget?

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:12.370
That's all I need to get out of this trap.
I just need one thing!

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.580
I need to recall it now.

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:18.090
If I don't recall it right this minute,
I'll forget it forever!

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:19.840
Just one thing!

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:22.630
What matters to me?

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:28.220
GO SEE EMPORIO

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.730
This is all I need.
I'll leave one memory open.

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:34.560
These two things.

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.810
These two things are all I need.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:40.280
The rest, I don't need.

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:42.690
I need to leave this place!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.200
I spilled… my water.

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:55.040
I need to… unplug the power.

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:57.500
The power is shorting out.

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:05.340
Or else, I can't leave out of
that exit to go see Jolyne.

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:09.850
I have things I need to tell Jolyne!

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:13.020
I can't forget them!

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:16.060
I have to leave this room!

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:24.820
I spilled my water.

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:26.820
MEMORY ONE: I SPILLED MY WATER

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:29.030
I need to… unplug the power.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.030
MEMORY TWO: I NEED TO UNPLUG THE POWER

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.740
The power is shorting out.

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:34.710
MEMORY THREE: THE POWER IS SHORTING

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:40.420
Or else, I can't leave out of that exit…

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:43.920
MEMORY FOUR: OR ELSE, I CAN'T LEAVE
THIS ROOM TO GO SEE JOLYNE

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:44.840
MEMORY THREE

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:46.430
…to go see Jolyne.

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:50.260
Wait a second.

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:52.100
"Go see Emporio"?

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:57.060
I'm sure I read that name on her arm.

00:21:57.560 --> 00:21:59.770
I need to go make sure.

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:04.110
No one can escape this place.

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:06.110
GO SEE EMPORIO

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:46.290
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
